    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0008:0001",
      "source": "`Subfactor`: The subfactor to multiply by, which [`SparseCreateSubfactor(_:_:)`](sparsecreatesubfactor(_:_:)-4renf.md) returns.",
      "ko": "`Subfactor`: [`SparseCreateSubfactor(_:_:)`](sparsecreatesubfactor(_:_:)-4renf.md)가 반환하는, 곱셈에 사용할 Subfactor입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "0652dcee859529e93ecf81bd8ac3fc728ebd45d979de36b737f1b11c89eb552a",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0008:0002",
      "source": "`X`: The matrix *X*.",
      "ko": "`X`: 행렬 *X*입니다.",
